ount":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"e1WJ1qcgF2TBkoYzopeTgQ","review_id":"cRCCG32yfcrIixRf9JeePw","date":"2014-03-27T16:09:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.948096513748169,"text_excerpt":"We ate here last week, while spending a few days in new orleans. We lucked out on the wait time, it was only about 20 minutes or so. You have to go upstairs to get to this restaurant. It is small and cozy, 11 tables. Cash only. We asked other diners their recommendations, everyone raved about everything. We ended up ordering the rack of lamb, which was so good we had to tell Adolpho how much we loved it. Honestly, the best we have ever eaten. It melts in your mouth. They put in in a rosemary sauce. Wow is all I can say. Also got the cannelloni, which was excellent too. It is worth the wait. You will be so happy you did!"},{"business_id":"e1WJ1qcgF2TBkoYzopeTgQ","review_id":"mM9eXP63UmkGEujt3Ks2VA","date":"2014-11-03T12:10:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9409950971603394,"text_excerpt":"Adolfo's is a unique place. It's right on Frenchman makes it busy and noisy at night. When we walked in we were very lucky to get a table right away. Our server was very sweet, and we asked her what were must haves on the menu. We started with the special mussels (white wine, butter). Only criticism was I wanted more broth! Give me bread and mussel broth and I'm happy. Mussels were tender and delicious. You could taste the freshness. For dinner, we got the snapper with ocean sauce (so fresh, worth every bite) and I got the veal piccata. Veal was classic pounded thin veal. Overall great experience, just don't fool yourself into thinking \"white tablecloth italian\". It's New Orleans people, ..."},{"business_id":"e1WJ1qcgF2TBkoYzopeTgQ","review_id":"OIWtDNNlHFG-m1lmJaEztQ","date":"2011-05-30T04:02:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9406172633171082,"text_excerpt":"This place is absolutely delicious. As a native of New Orleans, I feel like I have been to my fair share of restaurants. We got some sort of oyster appetizer with spinach that was the best oysters I have had in my life. party in your mouth. Get there early because it gets crowded. We arrived around 6 and were in and out within an hour. The prices are very reasonable and the service was good but it seems like the servers are on duty for waiting tables, bussing, and playing hostess all at once so don't get upset if they forget to re-fill your water. They're doing their best. I'm usually not a fan of Italian but this was pretty fantastic so i will definitely be back!! Also, Frenchman street ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"e1WJ1qcgF2TBkoYzopeTgQ","photo_id":"7lJPB6ql7ye6eD-xEG5uLA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/7lJPB6ql7ye6eD-xEG5uLA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8442171216011047},{"business_id":"e1WJ1qcgF2TBkoYzopeTgQ","photo_id":"vcGxflIWVgg8EM20vNdT4w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/vcGxflIWVgg8EM20vNdT4w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8434990048408508},{"business_id":"e1WJ1qcgF2TBkoYzopeTgQ","photo_id":"jufX7yGE6sHtmbrhvU4kEQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/jufX7yGE6sHtmbrhvU4kEQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8094160556793213},{"business_id":"e1WJ1qcgF2TBkoYzopeTgQ","photo_id":"qpzxnvkrQxmy2k9dmrbQ8Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/qpzxnvkrQxmy2k9dmrbQ8Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8036100268363953},{"business_id":"e1WJ1qcgF2TBkoYzopeTgQ","photo_id